{
  "appid": "b8f9915e-230e-481d-a223-9b436359974a",
  "name": "MedAdvice Identity Provider",
  "description": "Simulated identity provider for the MedAdvice / DemoBot workshop personas. Supports get user, list user sessions, disable user, enable user and clear user sessions. The app never contacts a directory and every result carries simulated=true - it exists so Splunk Enterprise Security (response plans and the Guided Response agent) can run a real, repeatable containment action in a lab.",
